lly different outcomes, and the body reports only the most favourable; (4) the basis for charge comparisons between True Potential and Aviva is unclear (platform only vs total charges); (5) alternatives are listed but not discussed. The report asserts a comparison was carried out (\"we have negotiated\", \"savings of £208\", \"lower overall cost structure\") but the evidence to support this comparison is incomplete or absent.","citations":[{"passageId":"P12","source":"Suitability report 2026.md","category":"I","quote":"If you were to retain the pension with Quilter the platform charges would be 0.27%.","cells":null},{"passageId":"P12","source":"Suitability report 2026.md","category":"I","quote":"Investment Funds: N/A; Risk Level: N/A","cells":null},{"passageId":"P3","source":"Suitability report 2026.md","category":"I","quote":null,"cells":["HSBC Global Strategy Dynamic Portfolio C Acc","50%","7","0.19%"]},{"passageId":"P3","source":"Suitability report 2026.md","category":"I","quote":null,"cells":["Vanguard LifeStrategy 80% Equity","50%","7","0.20%"]},{"passageId":"P1","source":"Suitability report 2026.md","category":"I","quote":"We have recommended a multi-asset fund because it provides a professionally managed, diversified investment solution that aligns with your financial goals and risk profile.","cells":null},{"passageId":"P4","source":"Suitability report 2026.md","category":"H","quote":"Financial strength - Aviva is rated A (Stable) by S&P, with £407bn AUM (31 Dec 2024).","cells":null},{"passageId":"P23","source":"expected-results.md","category":"-","quote":"The switching analysis excludes the £260,000 pension credit entirely. All four SelectaPension runs cover only True Potential and Nest (£67,945.44), and Quilter is absent from the Pension Switch Charges table.","cells":null},{"passageId":"P23","source":"expected-results.md","category":"-","quote":"Four switching analyses were run with materially different answers and the body reports the two most favourable.