## Pension Portfolio risks
The value of your pension pot and the retirement benefits it can provide may go down as well as up.
You could get back less than has been invested.
The value of your investment and retirement benefits depends on:
 the level of payments made into your Pension Portfolio
 the performance of your chosen investments
 the charges you pay.
