by Your Adviser;
 where the Aviva Platform is the Transferring Platform, by the Receiving Platform;
unless, in any of these cases, We reasonably believe that person or entity does not have authority to provide the instruction on Your behalf. During a Unit Transfer, there may be a period between the point of Unit conversion and completion of the transfer process, where You may incur a more expensive charge from the Fund manager. If You have questions, Your Adviser will be able to give You details.
